    {
      "id": "s1",
      "type": "info",
      "text": "A **formula** can give the wrong total when its range stops too early, points at the wrong column, or has its arguments in the wrong order. Check that each range covers exactly the data you mean, text criteria are in quotes, and SUMIFS starts with the sum range."
    },
    {
